{
  "iri": "https://strandz.it/jigdaw/plugins/quartet/",
  "label": "Quartet",
  "comment": "Eight-voice four-operator FM synthesiser with eleven algorithms, band-limited sine, saw and square operators, per-operator envelopes, feedback, optional 2x oversampling, a pitch envelope and a multimode filter. It opens as a mono bass.",
